{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31582","headline":"和吴中丞悼笙妓 · 李羣玉","name":"和吴中丞悼笙妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丽质仙姿烟逐风，凤皇声断吹台空。\n多情草色怨还绿，无主杏花春自红。\n堕珥尚存芳树下，余香渐减玉堂中。\n唯应去抱云和管，从此长归阿母宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}